"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5186630","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4586360-1843481262690323","game_id":"steam-4586360","kind":"announcement","title":"The Iskarn demo is out !","summary":"Hey everyone ! It's live: the Iskarn demo is free on this page right now. Go build something. What's in it - 5 nights to found your colony and hold the line against whatever crawls out of the dark - The real game, not a slice: build block by block, craft in your workshops, explore the ruins, take control of your hero, keep the menhir burning - English, French, German, Polish and Russian Your colony carries over When dawn breaks after your fifth night, the demo ends but your save doesn't. In the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T20:15:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690323","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4586360-1838407329257566","game_id":"steam-4586360","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #10","summary":"Devlog #10 Borrowed Daylight Hey everyone! Two things today. Playtest signups are open, and since you are about to step into this world, it is time I told you what is going on in it. The playtest is open The build is live and it is the real game: the full prologue, colony management, night sieges, exploration, and possession, where you drop into your hero's body and fight it out yourself instead of watching from above. Signups are open right now, and they go through the Discord: join us, ask for","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T18:16:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329257566","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4586360-1835871199311158","game_id":"steam-4586360","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #9","summary":"Devlog #9 Raise the Stone Hey @everyone! Big week. Territory was reborn around a single object, hunger learned to bite back, and stepping into your hero just got a whole lot more obvious. Raise the Stone Claiming land is now a real gesture. You place a menhir, a runic standing stone, and watch it surge up out of the ground to anchor your territory. The claimed zone then grows outward in stages, like ground being won rather than painted onto a map. The old manual territory tool is gone, and hones","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-21T16:09:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199311158","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4586360-1835236783568271","game_id":"steam-4586360","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #8","summary":"Devlog #8 Plant or Perish Hey @everyone! This one is all about food: Iskarn now has real farming, and the seasons actually decide whether your colony eats. From dirt to dinner Mark out a field like you would a stockpile, pick one of four crops, and your Farmers take it from there: they till each tile by hand to turn raw ground into workable soil, sow the seeds, tend the crop, and bring in the harvest. Every plant climbs through four visible growth stages: - Sown soil: freshly planted, nothing sh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-14T18:14:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783568271","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4586360-1834602721196768","game_id":"steam-4586360","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #7","summary":"Devlog #7 Into the Ruins Hey @everyone ! This week was all about one thing: giving you reasons to leave the safety of your village and head out into the unknown. Iskarn now has a living world, full of places to explore, loot, and people to save. A world worth exploring The wilds around your colony are now scattered with abandoned places: hunter's camps, burned inns, ruined mills, flooded mines, fallen citadels and plenty more. They appear naturally as you push outward, and the further you travel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-07T19:25:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721196768","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4586360-1833968530895716","game_id":"steam-4586360","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #6","summary":"Devlog #6 You are the Hero ! Hey everyone ! Last week I teased a major feature I was rethinking from the ground up. It's here, and honestly, it changes how Iskarn feels to play. The goal with all of this : give the player real impact, pull you into the world, deepen the immersion. Stop being a god moving pieces on a board, become one of the people fighting to keep the colony alive. Be the Hero You're not just the architect floating above the colony anymore. You have a Hero, the main character of","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-31T18:00:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530895716","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4586360-1832065502819841","game_id":"steam-4586360","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #5","summary":"Devlog #5 The Weight of Steel Hey everyone! Last week brought horde leaders and gate assaults. This week was all about polish: making every single sword swing actually feel like it lands. Hit feel Every connecting blow now has layered punch: - A bright white flash on impact, then the red damage flash settles in - Heavy hits trigger a short camera shake, only for fights happening near you so distant skirmishes don't shake your view - Blood bursts double in intensity on heavy hits - Sword strikes ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-10T19:00:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502819841","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4586360-1831432155576085","game_id":"steam-4586360","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #4","summary":"Hey everyone ! Combat just got a massive overhaul. Last few weeks turned night assaults from a chore into something tense. Per-citizen stances No more global combat mode. Each citizen has their own stance, set from a new Selection Action Bar : - Peace : civilian, only fights back if cornered. - Defensive : holds position, engages within weapon range. - Aggressive : pursues threats, then comes home after the kill. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46077879/c58c4f8322ff16055be84f96cdbb72b0174c00b3.png Mix stance","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-03T20:00:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155576085","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4586360-1830797770240788","game_id":"steam-4586360","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #3","summary":"Hey everyone! This one is big, nights just got teeth. The zombies got a full top-to-bottom rework: how they appear, how they move, how they sound, how they die at dawn. Five faces of the dead Iskarn now has five distinct undead tiers in rotation. A baseline brute, a fragile runner, a bloated tank, a plague-carrier trailing toxic spores, and a rune-marked elite that shows up rarely enough that seeing one actually means something. Each has its own silhouette, tempo, and voice, you'll recognize the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-26T19:08:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770240788","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4586360-1830163047264553","game_id":"steam-4586360","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #2","summary":"Hey @everyone ! Spent the last weeks going deep on the construction system, more shapes, more materials, and smarter rendering. Here's what changed. The catalog now sits at 32 buildable blocks Before : 21. Now : 32. That's 11 brand new building blocks, covering the shapes that were missing for proper medieval architecture : half-blocks, pillars, and a new signature material. Timber framing joined the roster The iconic half-timbered Fachwerk look now has its own block, cream plaster with a dark w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-19T19:26:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047264553","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4586360-1830163047258538","game_id":"steam-4586360","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #1","summary":"Hey @everyone ! This is my very first devlog for Iskarn. The game has been in development for a while now and is already quite feature-rich, but I've been quietly working on it without sharing much. Time to change that ! Here's what the last two weeks looked like. Performance overhaul, +150% FPS I spent a good chunk of time digging into performance bottlenecks. After a lot of profiling and reworking some core rendering logic, the game now runs at over 2.5× the framerate it used to (120 to 300+ f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-16T20:35:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047258538","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4586360-1829528821318233","game_id":"steam-4586360","kind":"announcement","title":"Iskarn - Roadmap 2026: Beta, Next Fest & Early Access","summary":"Thank you to everyone who has already wishlisted Iskarn! Here's what to expect in 2026.What's already in the game Iskarn is already a rich game with many mechanics in place:Free-form voxel building with over 15 block types20+ furniture and decorations to place7 professions with XP progression52 crafting recipes across 8 different workshopsFull combat system: weapons and armor from copper to steelEnemies: zombies and nightly hordesAnimal husbandry (sheep, cows, donkeys)4 playable biomes with dyna","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-14T16:00:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821318233","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4586360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:29Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:29Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4586360":"2026-10-26T12:54:29Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4586360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:29Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:29Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:29Z"},"5186630":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:29Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:29Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at